2. **Series**: A Series in pandas is a one-dimensional labelled array capable of holding any data type (integers, strings, floating-point numbers, Python objects, etc.). The axis labels are collectively called index. A `pd.Series` can be created by passing a list, numpy array or even a `dictionary`--------------------            Assert.GreaterOrEqual(index,0);

